What does this print? Write the four lines separated by single spaces.

```pascal
try
  try
    WriteLn('A');
    raise Exception.Create('B');
    WriteLn('C');
  finally
    WriteLn('D');
  end;
except
  on E: Exception do
    WriteLn(E.Message);
end;
WriteLn('E');
```

With the lesson's `TIntRing`, what does this print? Write the numbers separated by single spaces.

```pascal
Temps := TIntRing.Create(4);
for N := 1 to 6 do
  Temps.Add(N);
for N in Temps.Items do
  Write(N, ' ');
```
